Third-party material

This repository aggregates camera recipes from other projects. The recipe
parameter values in catalog/filters.json and the structure of the generated
Recipes.java derive from voxivoid/recipe-lab-sony-pmca (MIT, (c) Andre
Domingues), whose app engine this repository builds on.

Some catalogued styles are registered by name only from
ukiki0718-netizen/sony-a5100-film-studio, which is licensed under
PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0. No fitted parameters from that project are
included here. See NOTICE.md for the full provenance and the scope of each
licence.

Brand names used in recipe names (Sony, Fujifilm, Kodak, Ricoh, Leica,
Hasselblad, Canon, Nikon, Panasonic, Olympus, Agfa, Ilford, Cinestill,
Polaroid, Instax) are trademarks of their respective owners and are used
descriptively only. This project is not affiliated with, or endorsed by,
any of those companies.
